# Regenerate with: VHS_NO_SANDBOX=true vhs docs/check.tape
Output docs/check.gif
Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 17
Set Width 1180
Set Height 760
Set Padding 26
Set Theme "Catppuccin Latte"
Set TypingSpeed 55ms
Sleep 500ms
Type "pz check examples/vibe-clinic | head -27"
Sleep 700ms
Enter
Sleep 4s
Screenshot docs/check.png
Sleep 7s
